{%- comment -%}
  journal-assets
  ----------------------------------------------------------------
  Loads the fonts + CSS/JS this feature needs, without requiring any
  edit to layout/theme.liquid. Rendered once from journal-hero.liquid
  and article-hero.liquid — the guaranteed-first section on the two
  JOURNAL templates — so it's present on every JOURNAL page exactly
  once per request.

  Your live theme (the one this is being added to) almost certainly
  already loads: the Cormorant Garamond / Noto Sans JP fonts, its main
  stylesheet (defining --black/--gold/.btn/.card/… — same tokens this
  feature relies on), and a script handling header scroll state, the
  mobile nav toggle, and the .reveal fade-in. Loading those AGAIN here
  would double up JS event listeners (e.g. the hamburger menu opening
  and immediately re-closing) — so only journal.css/journal.js, which
  are genuinely new, are included by default.

  If this is going into a brand-new/empty theme with none of that
  already present, uncomment the four lines below instead.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%}
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400&family=Noto+Sans+JP:wght@300;400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ 'theme.css' | asset_url }}">
<script src="{{ 'theme.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
{%- endcomment -%}

<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ 'journal.css' | asset_url }}">
<script src="{{ 'journal.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
